== eval-alpha-transport-size: train-alpha-off-het with the transport law and the size gate (twin, test seeds 0-39)
   law L2: alpha = max(0, 3 - 6 sigma) x clip((0.2971 - x) / (0.2971 - 0.1751), 0, 1), x = travel / op time / AGVs per machine; gate F1 PASS
